# Caddy reverse proxy for Sentry402 (Stage 3b — automatic HTTPS).
# SITE_ADDRESS is the public hostname: use <ip>.sslip.io for free TLS with no
# domain purchase (sslip.io resolves the IP-encoded name back to your IP), or
# point your own domain's A record at the instance and use that instead.
{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
